# Frontend rules

- Use Vue 3 Composition API with `<script setup lang="ts">` and existing
  components/CSS variables.
- Put shared HTTP calls in `frontend/src/lib`, API types in
  `frontend/src/types`, pages in `views`, and reusable UI in `components` or
  `widgets`.
- Preserve current Ukrainian/Russian wording and handle loading, empty, and
  error states.
- Keep the UI dense and operational; do not add a UI library without a clear
  need.
- Before checks, use Node 22.18+ or 24.12+. Run `cd frontend && npm run build`.
  Known pre-existing type errors are documented in `AGENTS.md`.
